# 统一文本判定与行尾，避免服务器提交、本机拉取来回显示已修改
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制，不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.onnx binary
*.ckpt binary
*.tar binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.zip binary
